			"subtitle": "An experimental Tor-enabled, Gecko-based web browser for iOS 15+.",
			"localizedDescription": "Onion Cider is a Tor-enabled, Gecko-based mobile web browser for iOS 15+.\n\nUnlike other browsers on iOS that are forced to use Apple's WebKit engine (including Safari and all third-party browsers), Onion Cider uses Gecko. This is the same engine that powers the Firefox browser on desktop and Android devices.\n\n Additionally, it contains a Tor client and support for different bridge types. \n\nSource code is available on GitHub at https://github.com/tladesignz/onion-cider.",
